<title>LEBANON: Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth 54 bln pounds.</title>
<headline>Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth 54 bln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lebanon said on Thursday it issued certificates of deposit dated July 11 to commercial banks worth 54 billion Lebanese pounds.</p>
<p>The bank sold 60-day certificates worth 50 billion pounds at 12.25 percent annual interest and 45-day CDs worth four billion pounds at 11.5 percent.</p>
<p>Last week the bank issued 60-day CDs worth 38 billion pounds and 45-day CDs worth two billion pounds at the same interest rates.</p>
<p>($1 = 1,538.75 Lebanese pounds)</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 345723 345740 602057</p>
